#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:3
#: f275d909e7f74976891eae328d551d3c
msgid "随机原子堆积（Random Packing）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:5
#: 89b051ce7b5244dbafb8aed1c52628c2
msgid "**分类：** 结构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:7
#: 7ebddcbbe6aa4996932b35f9c96a4e7e
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:9
#: 04bf96d817a741eba9d2c9806c4af1dd
msgid ""
"`Random Packing` 是原子坐标卡，不是磁性卡。它保留输入结构的 `cell` 和 `pbc`，"
"按输入组成或手动精确组成在 cell 内重新随机放置原子，并用全局和 pair-specific "
"最小距离约束挡掉明显不可能的短键初态。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Packing` operates on atomic coordinates, not magnetic moments. It "
"preserves the input `cell` and `pbc`, then redistributes atoms inside the "
"cell using either the input composition or an explicitly specified integer "
"composition. Global and pair-specific minimum distances reject clearly "
"impossible short-contact starting states."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:11
#: af3ec8a052c84f5388b2d0498754d1c8
msgid ""
"这张卡解决的是“训练集缺少无序初始构型”，不是“缺少磁矩无序”。磁矩无序使用 "
"`Spin Disorder` 或 `Correlated Random Spin`。"
msgstr ""
"Use this card when the training set lacks structurally disordered starting "
"configurations. For disordered magnetic moments, use `Spin Disorder` or "
"`Correlated Random Spin` instead."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:13
#: 5fa8ceffdaf24831a6d21a7da343ee98
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:15
#: e131593f207d4bda9e78fcff0ed79794
msgid ""
"程序在输入晶胞内依次随机放置原子。候选分数坐标 $\\mathbf s\\sim U([0,1)^3)$，"
"Cartesian 坐标为 $\\mathbf r=\\mathbf s^\\mathsf T\\mathbf C$。对新原子 $i$，"
"只有满足"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:19
#: 1b19a954c06046568a238226883963c9
msgid ""
"\n"
"d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}\\ge d_{\\min}(Z_i,Z_j)\n"
"\\qquad \\forall j<i\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:24
#: 6bc8a74c686e4a4d97c260adaf3784cf
msgid ""
"才接受该位置。元素对专用阈值优先于全局最小距离；所有距离单位为 Å。程序优先放"
"置约束更大 的元素，以降低后期无位置可放的概率，但它仍是带拒绝的随机顺序算法，"
"不保证在高密度条件下 一定找到解。达到每原子最大尝试次数后，严格模式报错，非严"
"格模式跳过该输出样本。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:28
#: bd9046b65543470abfd1cf8b5be9a8f2
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:30
#: c81f9938cf3f45bc8edf76c5f9a40bc5
msgid "场景：模型只见过有序晶格，遇到无序初态能量排序不稳定"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: a model trained only on ordered lattices gives unstable energy "
"rankings for disordered starting states"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:32
#: deb1363ae9b140bab103fe990e157f74
msgid ""
"输入是一个已有 cell 和组成的候选结构。你希望在相同 cell 和元素计数下生成 20 "
"个随机原子 packing，用于 amorphous seed、液相初态或高温无序初态的 DFT 采样。"
msgstr ""
"The input is a candidate structure with a defined cell and composition. You "
"want 20 random packings with the same cell and element counts for use as "
"amorphous seeds, liquid starting states, or high-temperature disordered "
"configurations for DFT sampling."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:34
#: 3aae602f1e984b019426e9f782270b2c
msgid ""
"参数设置：`structures=20`，`composition=\"\"`，`min_distance=1.5`，"
"`pair_min_distances=\"Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2\"`，`strict_mode=True`，打开 `使用随机"
"种子`（`use_seed`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:36
#: f273589f5f6b40cb90da6741f778bf30
msgid ""
"输出结构保留原 cell/pbc 和元素计数，坐标随机重排，`Config_type` 追加 "
"`RandPack(...)`。检查输出时重点看最短距离分布和后续 DFT 是否仍有明显短键崩"
"溃。"
msgstr ""
"Each output preserves the original cell, periodicity, and element counts "
"while randomizing coordinates. `RandPack(...)` is appended to `Config_type`. "
"Validate the minimum-distance distribution and check whether subsequent DFT "
"calculations still fail because of short contacts."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:38
#: 01eecc53910f445fbeaab14f86974038
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:40
#: d286f015826445e6991c461d524222d0
msgid "组成和数量"
msgstr "Composition and count"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:42
#: 0f78fe8261bf4cdd919d593f03568bcb
msgid "结构数（structures）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:44
#: 42de43b1e91944b092db051ecb983f2d
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成几个独立的随机 packing 版本。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `1`. Number of independent random packings generated for "
"each input structure."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:46
#: f7523b60dd7241c083680aecf2b84b13
msgid ""
"10-20 个适合无序初始构型试探；50+ 时注意——每个输出结构都要靠随机试错来放置，"
"高密度体系会显著变慢，而且 DFT 预算也成倍放大。"
msgstr ""
"Use 10–20 to probe disordered starting states. At 50 or more, placement can "
"become slow in dense systems because each structure relies on repeated "
"random trials, and the downstream DFT cost grows proportionally."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:48
#: 8113927ae8f64d04825509ba9965d301
msgid "组成（composition）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:50
#: a7a3b2f858c64f859b9c0ac805eeef80
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。留空 = 沿用输入结构的元素种类和原子计数。手动指定时写整数计"
"数，如 `Fe:32, O:64`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: empty. Leave empty to preserve the input elements and atom "
"counts. To override them, provide integer counts such as `Fe:32, O:64`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:52
#: 31857d9295da44208049e154bddf4518
msgid ""
"注意这一卡不接受比例（不接受 `Fe:0.33` 这种写法）。因为随机 packing 需要确切"
"知道每个种类有多少个原子才能放置。"
msgstr ""
"Fractions such as `Fe:0.33` are not accepted. Random packing requires an "
"exact integer count for every species before placement begins."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:54
#: 5df13dbd3f37494faf5947284971571d
msgid "距离约束"
msgstr "Distance constraints"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:56
#: 1db5013ef52f402ea6d3dd5dc2ddcb98
msgid ""
"原子是一个一个随机扔进盒子里的。每扔一个，都要检查它跟已经放置的所有原子之间"
"的距离够不够大。下面三个参数控制\"多大算够大\"以及\"试多少次放弃\"。"
msgstr ""
"Atoms are placed one at a time. Every candidate position is checked against "
"all atoms already placed. The following parameters define the required "
"separation and the number of failed trials allowed before placement gives up."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:58
#: e731056e46a04a11bb2f49e0facab221
msgid "最小距离（min_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:60
#: f4b98cc20aa54ea8a737509bc6ae8dcc
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.5 Å。全局最小原子对距离——任何两个原子都不允许比这个值更近。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `1.5` Å. Global minimum pair distance; no two atoms may be "
"closer than this value."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:62
#: 8c6ea95ce74947c6a8573a52538888e9
msgid ""
"设太小会放行短键坏结构，设太大在高密度 cell 里可能根本放不下所有原子。一个安"
"全的起点是：取体系最短合理键长的 70-90%。比如 Si-Si 键约 2.35 Å，设 1.8 Å 通"
"常没问题。"
msgstr ""
"A value that is too small admits bad short-contact structures, while one "
"that is too large may make a dense cell impossible to fill. A useful "
"starting point is 70–90% of the shortest chemically reasonable bond length. "
"For example, with a Si–Si bond near 2.35 Å, 1.8 Å is often a sensible "
"initial constraint."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:64
#: e94b7e7479fc45f4821e8db3d065bcbf
msgid "分元素对最小距离（pair_min_distances）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:66
#: f56c3558e1274b3a9917d30f28075bb4
msgid "`str`，默认空。按元素对覆盖全局距离。例如 `Fe-O:1.8, O-O:1.2`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: empty. Element-pair overrides for the global distance, for "
"example `Fe-O:1.8, O-O:1.2`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:68
#: 1433cc21fb2842d9b8b2346de02284a4
msgid ""
"元素半径差异大时你会想用这个——O-O 通常比 Fe-O 可以更近一些，同时 Fe-O 可能需"
"要比全局 `最小距离`（`min_distance`）更宽松。写在 pair 里的距离覆盖全局值，没"
"写的元素对仍然用 `最小距离`（`min_distance`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:70
#: 1c6650dc7bf4492685601547e8814f6c
msgid "每个原子最大尝试次数（max_attempts_per_atom）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:72
#: b3a9c59fc2684a9993de0ac789533f27
msgid "`int`，默认 500。每个原子最多随机尝试多少次放置位置，超过就认为放不下。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `500`. Maximum random position trials for each atom before "
"that placement is considered impossible."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:74
#: 70442c68bd214ae89babbcc98937042c
msgid ""
"增大它只增加搜索时间，不改变物理可行性。如果你发现它一直失败（几乎每次都触达 "
"500 次上限），不是该调大它——是你的 `最小距离`（`min_distance`）设大了，或者 "
"cell 相对原子数太小。先调松距离或扩胞。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:76
#: 584e7f805421422faffd0180cdcb12bc
msgid "严格模式（strict_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:78
#: e3ffc656e0144e98821b60fb7fcbbc17
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。打开：只要有一个原子放不下，整个样本就报错，保证输出数量 "
"= 设定值。关闭：放不下的样本被跳过，最终输出可能比你设的 `结构数`"
"（`structures`）少。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:80
#: efafbe107b434eef96ae364dba40b1db
msgid ""
"如果你在做参数扫描、不确定什么约束组合能放得下→ 先关掉 strict，看实际产出了几"
"个样本，再决定要不要调参数。"
msgstr ""
"When scanning uncertain constraint combinations, disable strict mode first "
"and inspect how many samples are accepted before tuning the parameters."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:82
#: 330523d15f144df99fcbf40279b59a35
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:84
#: 5ad75a1a0aae48319ed1564fa501da2d
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:86
#: fe411de5aa5a4220b9d8079405cd301d
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后同参数同输入 → 相同的 packing 结果。对比实验时开，"
"纯探索可以关。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Enable it to reproduce the same packing from the "
"same input and parameters. Use it for controlled comparisons; it may remain "
"disabled during exploration."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:88
#: 7058b644509940e38449df0b789dde78
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:90
#: e75ce491d9b84c2aafe7a067d41acee0
msgid "`int`，默认 0。仅 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）打开时生效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:92
#: 1c31305bda224ebcb481575fcf328717
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:94
#: cf46de4754c54c309dd7f4f935effcb4
msgid "保持输入组成"
msgstr "Preserve the input composition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:96
#: 3c8e4505d03e4e52a4a33dac03d38cc7
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomPackingCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"structures\": 10,\n"
"    \"composition\": \"\",\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 1.5,\n"
"    \"pair_min_distances\": \"\",\n"
"    \"max_attempts_per_atom\": 500,\n"
"    \"strict_mode\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:112
#: 0995882b2452492d97c93733ac348d46
msgid "手动精确组成"
msgstr "Specify an exact composition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:114
#: 74413ed138224993b27b6e3560e01be5
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomPackingCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"structures\": 20,\n"
"    \"composition\": \"Fe:32,O:64\",\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 1.4,\n"
"    \"pair_min_distances\": \"Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2,Fe-Fe:2.0\",\n"
"    \"max_attempts_per_atom\": 1000,\n"
"    \"strict_mode\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:130
#: 2d19a30001514935a07e5d13c4e8f4cf
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:132
#: 93afc24de2ec4d0f9d2a84a36498b021
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Random Packing`：复用目标 cell 尺度"
"生成无序 seed。"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Random Packing`: establish the "
"target cell size, then generate disordered seeds in that cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:133
#: 525ff4ca294a48dbb67c4b6324ab2b33
msgid ""
"`Random Packing → Geometry Filter`：先生成，再过滤短键、体积和密度异常。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Packing → Geometry Filter`: generate candidates, then reject "
"abnormal contacts, volumes, or densities."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:134
#: acdcbed2f5bc4f5aa50ee90448e17035
msgid ""
"`Random Packing → Atomic Perturb`：在已经满足硬距离约束的无序 seed 上叠加小位"
"移噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Packing → Atomic Perturb`: add small displacement noise to a "
"disordered seed that already satisfies hard distance constraints."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:136
#: 5d7f929d3f4e494bb17482d5ef679773
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:138
#: d33437f58b6f43f98dd06844ccfdacb4
msgid ""
"**为什么不接受比例组成？** 因为这张卡生成真实原子列表，必须知道整数原子数。比"
"例到整数的舍入会改变组成语义，应该在上游先确定超胞和计数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are fractional compositions not accepted?** The card must construct a "
"concrete atom list with integer counts. Rounding fractions would change "
"their composition semantics, so determine the supercell and exact counts "
"upstream."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:140
#: 32c5cdaeb87c493f9f8c2fc9a91945f0
msgid ""
"**为什么默认 strict？** 链式卡片里输出数量通常会继续相乘。默认跳过失败样本会"
"让后续数量偏离用户设定，所以默认保持严格数量契约。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is strict mode the default?** In a card chain, downstream operations "
"often multiply the current output count. Silently skipping failed samples "
"would make later counts diverge from the user's plan, so the default "
"enforces an explicit count contract."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:142
#: 4db397125b47429bae800cb3ff0d01b4
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

