msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-packing-card.md:148
#: a5c5c0df200e4ca595a31021a4438d59
msgid ""
"开启 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）后，随机 packing 由 `随机种子`（`seed`）、输"
"入结构稳定 ID 和 sample 序号共同决定。相同输入、相同参数、相同 seed 会生成相"
"同坐标。"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "参数设置：`structures=20`，`composition=\"\"`，`min_distance=1.5`，"
#~ "`pair_min_distances=\"Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2\"`，`strict_mode=True`，打开 "
#~ "`use_seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Set `structures=20`, `composition=\"\"`, `min_distance=1.5`, "
#~ "`pair_min_distances=\"Fe-O:1.8,O-O:1.2\"`, and `strict_mode=True`, then "
#~ "enable `use_seed`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "元素半径差异大时你会想用这个——O-O 通常比 Fe-O 可以更近一些，同时 Fe-O 可能"
#~ "需要比全局 `min_distance` 更宽松。写在 pair 里的距离覆盖全局值，没写的元素"
#~ "对仍然用 `min_distance`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use pair overrides when species have substantially different sizes or "
#~ "contact requirements. A listed pair replaces the global constraint; "
#~ "unlisted pairs continue to use `min_distance`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "增大它只增加搜索时间，不改变物理可行性。如果你发现它一直失败（几乎每次都触"
#~ "达 500 次上限），不是该调大它——是你的 `min_distance` 设大了，或者 cell 相"
#~ "对原子数太小。先调松距离或扩胞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Increasing this limit only spends more search time; it cannot make an "
#~ "infeasible packing physically possible. If most placements exhaust all "
#~ "500 attempts, reduce `min_distance` or use a larger cell before "
#~ "increasing the attempt count."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 true。打开：只要有一个原子放不下，整个样本就报错，保证输出数"
#~ "量 = 设定值。关闭：放不下的样本被跳过，最终输出可能比你设的 `structures` "
#~ "少。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `true`. When enabled, failure to place any atom raises "
#~ "an error for the sample, enforcing the requested output-count contract. "
#~ "When disabled, failed samples are skipped and the output count may be "
#~ "lower than `structures`."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。仅 `use_seed` 打开时生效。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default: `0`. Used only when `use_seed` is enabled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "开启 `use_seed` 后，随机 packing 由 `seed`、输入结构稳定 ID 和 sample 序号"
#~ "共同决定。相同输入、相同参数、相同 seed 会生成相同坐标。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `use_seed` enabled, the packing is determined jointly by `seed`, the "
#~ "input structure's stable ID, and the sample index. The same input, "
#~ "parameters, and seed reproduce the same coordinates."
